msgid "Section ``[env]``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projectconf/sections/env/index.rst:20
msgid ""
"Each project may have multiple *configuration environments* defining the "
"available project tasks for building, programming, debugging, unit testing, "
"device monitoring, library dependencies, etc. The configuration environments "
"are declared using ``[env]`` sections in :ref:`projectconf`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projectconf/sections/env/index.rst:26
msgid "The allowed options are listed under `Options`_."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projectconf/sections/env/index.rst:29
msgid "Common ``[env]``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projectconf/sections/env/index.rst:31
msgid ""
"An optional configuration environment with common options that will be "
"shared between all ``[env:NAME]`` environments in the platformio.ini file. "
"It is very useful if the configuration file has a lot of environments ``[env:"
"NAME]`` and they share common settings."
msgstr ""

